# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
# Ignore everything by default and re-include only needed files
**

# Re-include Go source files
!**/*.go

# Re-include Go module files
!go.mod
!go.sum

# Re-include the workspace. go.work lists the operator, the SDK and every collector, and go build
# needs each module that it lists, with its go.mod, go.sum and files. The SDK embeds its JSON
# Schemas, and the other directories can embed files of their own.
!go.work
!go.work.sum
!sdk/
!collectors/
!templates/
!**/*.json

# Leave out test files, in every directory. This comes last, so that the directories above don't
# bring their test files back.
**/*_test.go
